{
    "title": "My Wafa - Assur",
    "description": "My Wafa is a free application for optimal management of your insurance and savings.\r\nHealth :\r\n\r\n    Access on-call pharmacies and approved care centers.\r\n    Consult and monitor your health records for each member and beneficiary.\r\n    Stay informed of the status of your files (missing information, counter-visit, etc.).\r\n    Request support online or submit an additional illness file.\r\n    Modify your RIB and securely access all your health insurance information. \r\n\r\nAuto:\r\n\r\n    Consult your car insurance contracts in your personal space.\r\n    Obtain personalized quotes thanks to the Scan To GO functionality of the registration document and license.\r\n    Pay for your insurance online and receive your certificate at home.\r\n    Declare and monitor your claims files in real time.\r\n    Request support and follow up on repairs with our approved repairers.\r\n    Benefit from rapid assistance in the event of an accident or breakdown thanks to geolocation.\r\n    Easily access emergency numbers. \r\n\r\nSaving :\r\n\r\n    Visualize your savings and their evolution over time.\r\n    View the details of your savings plan and the history of your transactions.\r\n    Discover the available investments offered by your company.\r\n    Use various tools and services to understand and manage your savings effectively. \r\n\r\nMy Wafa offers an intuitive interface, personalized notifications and secure access to all your information. Whether for your health, your car or your savings, My Wafa is your trusted partner for simplified and efficient management.\r\nDownload My Wafa today and take control of your insurance and finances with ease!",
    "descriptionHTML": "My Wafa is a free application for optimal management of your insurance and savings.<br>Health :<br><br>    Access on-call pharmacies and approved care centers.<br>    Consult and monitor your health records for each member and beneficiary.<br>    Stay informed of the status of your files (missing information, counter-visit, etc.).<br>    Request support online or submit an additional illness file.<br>    Modify your RIB and securely access all your health insurance information. <br><br>Auto:<br><br>    Consult your car insurance contracts in your personal space.<br>    Obtain personalized quotes thanks to the Scan To GO functionality of the registration document and license.<br>    Pay for your insurance online and receive your certificate at home.<br>    Declare and monitor your claims files in real time.<br>    Request support and follow up on repairs with our approved repairers.<br>    Benefit from rapid assistance in the event of an accident or breakdown thanks to geolocation.<br>    Easily access emergency numbers. <br><br>Saving :<br><br>    Visualize your savings and their evolution over time.<br>    View the details of your savings plan and the history of your transactions.<br>    Discover the available investments offered by your company.<br>    Use various tools and services to understand and manage your savings effectively. <br><br>My Wafa offers an intuitive interface, personalized notifications and secure access to all your information. Whether for your health, your car or your savings, My Wafa is your trusted partner for simplified and efficient management.<br>Download My Wafa today and take control of your insurance and finances with ease!",
